SCOPE

The MIT licence above covers the SOURCE CODE and the plugin built from it:
everything under src/, tools/, the build and packaging scripts, the PrismaUI
view (prisma-patch/), the FOMOD installer and the documentation.

It does NOT cover two things in this repository:

  Sound effects (sounds/, shipped as Sound/fx/isekai/)
      Licensed third-party assets. They are used here under their own licence,
      which does not permit relicensing them under the MIT terms above. If you
      fork this project, replace them or obtain your own licence for them.

  Icons (icons/)
      AI-generated artwork made for this mod. Free to reuse alongside the code;
      not part of the third-party carve-out above.

THIRD-PARTY CODE

  CommonLibSSE-NG, Dear ImGui, spdlog and fmt are used under their own MIT
  licences. The PrismaUI API header (src/PrismaUI_API.h) is vendored from the
  PrismaUI SKSE example plugin, which invites exactly that use.

  The crafting-station "zero transfer" technique is adapted from SCIE - Skyrim
  Crafting Inventory Extender by ohfor (MIT). SCIE is not a dependency; the
  approach is reimplemented here.
